{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is facing a disease of unknown origin, resulting in a large number of humans going missing or mutating into monsters that only know killing and eating. The survivors have formed various resistance and self-defense organizations to fight against these monsters in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will control the protagonist and use bullet hell attacks to eliminate enemies. During battles, the protagonist can acquire and upgrade various additional weapons to enhance combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You continue fighting until your stamina runs out (HP reaches zero), then return to the base to upgrade your abilities before heading back into battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582020?t=1745062944","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582020/b13b9d21d97f2840035103440c1a045535db3e1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745062944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582020/66c0ca7e9137ab4dad27b933b4b57ffc50eded6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745062944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582020/66c0ca7e9137ab4dad27b933b4b57ffc50eded6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745062944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is facing a disease of unknown origin, resulting in a large number of humans going missing or mutating into monsters that only know killing and eating. The survivors have formed various resistance and self-defense organizations to fight against these monsters in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will control the prot